---
// apps/frontend/site/src/lib/components/sections/features.astro
---

<section id="features" class="border-b border-border/70">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <span class="eyebrow text-rune">The Vision</span>
      <h2 class="mt-5 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl leading-tight">
        Every character truly lives.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Inspired by Baldur&apos;s Gate and classic tabletop RPGs, Aikami runs entirely on your
        hardware. Every NPC is driven by local AI — no cloud dependency, no subscriptions, no API
        quotas. Just an infinite, evolving world that you own.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="mt-14 grid gap-px bg-border border border-border rounded-sm overflow-hidden md:grid-cols-2"
    >
      <div class="bg-card p-8 md:p-10 group hover:bg-card/80 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
          <span class="font-serif text-5xl leading-none text-rune tabnum">01</span>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-tight">Relationship-Driven</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Steal from your healer and they&apos;ll be less inclined to heal you. Smooth-talk a
              trader and get a discount. Every NPC remembers how you treat them — with AI-managed
              relationship scores that evolve over time.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-card p-8 md:p-10 group hover:bg-card/80 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
          <span class="font-serif text-5xl leading-none text-rune tabnum">02</span>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-tight">Dynamic Ally System</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Any NPC can become your ally — and may leave you if they no longer trust you. If an
              NPC idolizes you, they might sacrifice themselves. AI-driven loyalty, fear, and
              devotion create unexpected emergent gameplay.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-card p-8 md:p-10 group hover:bg-card/80 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
          <span class="font-serif text-5xl leading-none text-rune tabnum">03</span>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-tight">Fear &amp; Bravery</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Scared NPCs stay at the back during fights. Train them, and they become braver.
              Emotional depth drives combat positioning and social dynamics — every NPC has a
              courage stat that changes based on experiences.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-card p-8 md:p-10 group hover:bg-card/80 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
          <span class="font-serif text-5xl leading-none text-rune tabnum">04</span>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-tight">AI-Generated Lore</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              The game generates its lore dynamically. Historical events, myths, and legends are
              created by the AI engine, providing a unique backstory every time you play. No two
              worlds are ever the same.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
